{"id":"657914","name":"小炒牛肉","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/657914/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"芹菜","amount":"1把"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜丝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉一块。","img":"images/657914/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"芹菜。","img":"images/657914/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"牛肉切片。","img":"images/657914/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入盐、酱油、淀粉、油拌匀。","img":"images/657914/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"姜丝、小米椒。","img":"images/657914/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"起锅烧油，芹菜入锅炒。","img":"images/657914/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加适量盐炒至断生，铲出备用。","img":"images/657914/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"净锅后再次热油，炒香姜丝。","img":"images/657914/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"牛肉入锅。","img":"images/657914/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炒至变色，放入小米椒。","img":"images/657914/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入芹菜翻炒。","img":"images/657914/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"最后加入蚝油调味即可。","img":"images/657914/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。鲜嫩好吃又下饭。","img":"images/657914/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}